DESCRIPTION:Rally with Trainers around the world for the mega conclusion o
 f Pokémon GO Fest 2026! Pokémon GO Fest 2026: Mega Finale brings Armored
  Mewtwo in five-star raids\, rotating habitats\, powerful Mega Raids\, and
  Super Mega Raids featuring Mega Mewtwo X and Mega Mewtwo Y.\n\nPrepare du
 ring the lead-up eventMega Ascension\, then join this unticketed worldwide
  weekend finale.\n\nThe Pokémon GO Fest 2026: Mega Finale event will take
  place from September 5\, 2026 at 10 am to September 6\, 2026 at 6 pm loca
 l time.\n\nMore info: https://leekduck.com/events/pokemon-go-fest-2026-meg
 a-finale/\n\nData from LeekDuck.com
